        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions #9 Large Reed with Scroll Ends Entry Door Handle</b>\r\n<p>\r\nStunning design door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Reed handle with decorative large scroll finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis entry door handle is made in the USA by the expert craftsmen at First Impressions International, famous for high quality innovational door pull designs. Available in 20\" or 24\" lengths and 12 different finish colors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" alt=\"made in the USA\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions #9  Door Handle\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Reed Style Brass Tubing</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 standard lengths.</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>FII-9A:  Total Length 20\", Center to Center Mount 11\"</li>\r\n<li>FII-9B: Total Length 23-3/4\", Center to Center Mount 14\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This decorative door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Other Lengths</b> up to 6 feet long. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged standard for  Surface Mounting (screws to the doors surface) with #10 x 1-1/2\" screws.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Large Reed with Scroll Door Handle, First Impressions #9",
                "description": "First Impressions #9 Decorative Door Pulls. Stunning design door pull handle from the First Impressions Classic Collection, combines the traditional beauty of Reed handle with decorative large Scroll finials. Used on both higher end residential and commercial doors.  Great for large entry glass doors or heavy solid wood doors.  Available in 20 or 23-3/4 inch lengths and 12 different finish colors. ",
